{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XENOTERRESTRIAL is a game about a man whose xenophobia is not so much earthly as it about extraterrestrials.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This top-down technical shooter, in the spirit of games like Hotline Miami and Ultrakill, combines skill with strategy for a fast paced, challenging experience. Experience easy-to-learn but hard-to-master technical shooter mechanics, a highly customizable loadout, highly replayable levels, and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features Include </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Weapons to Use In tandem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive customization (5 mods available for each weapon) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several other cooldown-based mechanics (gear collected by the player) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A central narrative </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex and diverse set of enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different difficulties for players of all ability (or those who are just looking for a different experience) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance related settings adjustments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex, technical mechanics reminiscent of games like Ultrakill and Doom </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret levels and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewarding rank and leveling systems that encourage both progression and replayability </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A style points system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Does the Game Include Right Now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, Xenoterrestrial includes the first two chapters, and a unique and challenging endless mode. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2623100?t=1769373954","backgr